    "body": "```suggestion\n      const attr = helper.state.hierarchicalFacets.find(\n        (facet) => facet.name === attribute\n      )?.name || attribute;\n      \n      helper.toggleFacetRefinement(attr, value);\n```\n\nnot sure if it's cleaner, but I think I prefer something along these lines. what do you think? ",
